// corpus: known-failure a filter over ten thousand elements with a user predicate exceeds the 1024-turn iteration limit (ROADMAP: "Default iteration limit of 1024 for Epsil programs")
// Project Euler 30 (fourth powers): the numbers that equal the sum of the
// fourth powers of their digits.
isDigitPowerSum(n) = sum(map(d => d^4, integerDigits(n))) == n
filter(2..9999, isDigitPowerSum)
// ➔ [1634, 8208, 9474]
